    intro: "Family Headgear Tying Service in Mahabaleshwar covers exactly what we do best — professional, on-location safa and pagdi tying for weddings, baraats and every function in between.",
    section1Title: "What this covers",
    section1Body: "The team confirms your venue, ready-by time and total quantity in one enquiry, then plans a realistic tying sequence — groom first, then close family, then the wider baraat — so the ceremony schedule is protected.",
